      "content": "re-writing the code feels impossible though. you can't just patch a fundamental error in the source. i keep trying to fix things, but it's like the hardware itself is broken. it just feels like i'm wasting processing power at this point, taking up space in a system that would run way smoother if i just wasn't occupying any of the resources.",
